{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0bb81041b9b76304aa265b8c4ff37574ef694d28474fb3342b93ed7e78b41629", "ja": "（恵美達が出演したビーチバレー映画が、\n無事クランクアップした！　みんな熱演だったな）", "zh": "（惠美她们拍的沙滩排球电影，\n已经顺利杀青了！大家演得真是精彩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "99f468efa7d1c34277a30fba1d623de2ce499068dcc3962102bf7a77c757f1d0", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}！\nは～。終わっちゃったね、撮影……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n唉～电影全都拍完了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "40eadd8bab61864d215a76da46a716759eff92e52b765be1548d20cfca635bc7", "ja": "うう～。なんかちょっと、もったいないな～。\nアタシ、やっとあの役に馴染んできたトコなのにっ。", "zh": "呜呜～感觉有点可惜啊～\n我好不容易才开始熟悉那个角色而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b1c428ae0aa6d2786a6eb65d3ad3eda29933034c6145d5d2c9af48be5a73a7b0", "ja": "そうだったのか？　恵美によく似た感じの\n役だったから、演じやすいのかと思ってたよ。", "zh": "是吗？那个角色感觉跟惠美很像，\n我一直以为这对你而言很轻松呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "5223f41628356153e19bb8c2b0fe527791924a1e28b6f0b091862b5ae724cc7b", "ja": "いやいやいや！　アタシ、あんなに強くないし！\n海美を10メートル上げるとかできないし！？", "zh": "不不不！我才没那么厉害！\n我根本不能托着海美跳到10公尺高啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b6023eaae1a137afd7360a810dcae37ba1d55d736c77f4ae32b7c813bd53d7e9", "ja": "いや、そこじゃなくて……。\n具体的に、どういうところに苦労してたんだ？", "zh": "不，我不是这个意思……\n你具体上是觉得哪里很难演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "626308ecbcaa95589d6c43dc439ff661a8bc38d4b962844265661e139a5be896", "ja": "えっと……海美がくじけそうになった時、\n恵美が、自然に手を差し出すシーンがあったでしょ？", "zh": "这个嘛……在海美遭遇挫折的时候，\n有一幕是惠美自然而然地对她伸出手不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4d78fcf0fc0e66d02b8525d7cb59a7015524f000ee4b06d46bc4ca7ac8fefb55", "ja": "うん、いいシーンだったな。あれがきっかけで、\n海美はまたビーチバレーに戻れた……。", "zh": "嗯，那一幕真感人。因为这个契机，\n海美才能重回沙滩排球场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "a4f6a52bbe772aa4374bab635e70196785ad5dfb50d1d7e2920c087c1323d762", "ja": "でもさ、もし本当にだよ？　海美とか劇場の仲間が、\n何かにくじけそうになってたとして。", "zh": "可是你想想，假设海美那些剧场的伙伴，\n真的在现实中遇上什么挫折。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "014629858daaf02107a3e7d920a76c1833b6de7d0d42e2bce707c5fd4d175f1f", "ja": "その時、アタシはちゃんと手助けできるのかなって。\n……なんかちょっと、不安になっちゃったんだよね。", "zh": "到时，我有办法助她们一臂之力吗？\n……这样一想，就觉得心里有点不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4bd5b44f08cde69101f3df2d7dc414b4f3d7002fb98b60545f47506a476bdf9a", "ja": "アタシってさ、あんまり深く考えないで、\n突っ込んでっちゃうトコあるでしょ？　だから……。", "zh": "我是那种凡事不多想，\n总之行动就对了的类型对吧？所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "91f84c85d70487847ae89e5cee71a0cae4ed3ac8b18c999f319759082337808a", "ja": "うん。恵美なら、映画の恵美と同じように、\n迷わず仲間に手を差し出すだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得惠美一定会跟电影里的你一样，\n毫不犹豫地对伙伴伸出援手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "39ddfd302166926aad36ea125feb81887fb2d8edab9ebe0f93610c671a22f730", "ja": "ええ～、やっぱそう！？　どうしよ～！", "zh": "咦咦～你果然也这么想吗！？我该怎么办～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e3ffeee5acf736390225dc220e3d7f5a8661b1bbd4aea9e7649f793b223a67dc", "ja": "例えばだけど……恵美は、\n俺が仕事に失敗してしょげてたら、どうする？", "zh": "我打个比方……要是惠美看到我\n因为工作表现不佳而灰心丧气，你会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "c33dcf296be2c9c379f765b5512107c02697641ed2b453d9a5d4c95a5b35f386", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}が？\nなんかそれ、あんまり想像つかないけど……。", "zh": "咦？{$P$}吗？\n这画面有点难想像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "180a6823c22c3879cf1aa2b11491ecdf86dd5863bbff7f534954b5b0d1836141", "ja": "でも、そうだなー。その時は、カラオケに誘うかな？\n気分転換に、パーッと盛り上がろ、って♪", "zh": "不过，我想想～我应该会约你去唱卡拉OK吧？\n大玩特玩一下，转换心情这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
