{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bb0ecaa0e7b7e925a618ff8eacc856a49684cdfc63115269e8140816801842d4", "ja": "手を伸ばしていいかどうかなんか考える前に、\nもう伸ばしてる。それでいいと思うよ。", "zh": "在你烦恼自己该不该帮忙的时候，\n你早就已经伸出援手了，我觉得保持这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0093_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "d04d5f0a4b5ef988ca9c0f08301678630671f708b17e4046d8b325d49ab01868", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそ、そう……なのかな？　えへ、えへへへへ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n是、是这样……吗？嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
